     "<div>\n<div><span></span>You have to make it like this,</div><div><div style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><div><font color=\"#660066\">df &lt;- df %&gt;% group_by(year) %&gt;% mutate(pos = </font><font color=\"#ff0000\"><b>100-(</b></font><font color=\"#660066\">cumsum(quantity)- quantity/2)</font><b><font color=\"#ff0000\">)</font></b></div><div><font color=\"#660066\"><br></font></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
