     "<div><blockquote style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0.5em\"><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>hi all...</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I found this example to label a pie chart...</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/24803460/r-ggplot2-add-labels-on-facet-pie-chart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/24803460/r-ggplot2-add-labels-on-facet-pie-chart&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367425126000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Gk7CXOn_ggSY-2OygeVMt\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/24803460/r-ggplot2-add-labels-on-facet-pie-chart</a></div><div><br></div><div>Issue:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">### data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>year </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"